<widget class="QWidget" name="pageUndead"><layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="undeadLayout"><property name="leftMargin"><number>0</number></property><property name="topMargin"><number>0</number></property><property name="rightMargin"><number>0</number></property><property name="bottomMargin"><number>0</number></property><item><widget class="QLabel" name="undeadRules"><property name="text"><string>填满非镜面格，并符合怪物总数及四周的视线数字：幽灵仅在反射后可见，吸血鬼仅直视可见，僵尸始终可见。左键选格后按 G/V/Z 或 1/2/3，也可点怪物按钮；右键或 Control＋左键选格写候选。方向键移动，回车切换候选，空格或退格清除。点击边缘数字标记完成。</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property></widget></item><item><widget class="QComboBox" name="undeadPreset" /></item><item><widget class="QWidget" name="undeadCustomSettings" native="true"><layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="undeadCustomLayout"><property name="leftMargin"><number>0</number></property><property name="topMargin"><number>0</number></property><property name="rightMargin"><number>0</number></property><property name="bottomMargin"><number>0</number></property><item><layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="undeadWidthLayout"><item><widget class="QLabel" name="undeadWidthLabel"><property name="text"><string>宽度</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property><property name="buddy"><cstring>undeadWidth</cstring></property></widget></item><item><widget class="QSpinBox" name="undeadWidth"><property name="minimum"><number>3</number></property><property name="maximum"><number>18</number></property><property name="value"><number>4</number></property><property name="keyboardTracking"><bool>false</bool></property></widget></item></layout></item><item><layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="undeadHeightLayout"><item><widget class="QLabel" name="undeadHeightLabel"><property name="text"><string>高度</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property><property name="buddy"><cstring>undeadHeight</cstring></property></widget></item><item><widget class="QSpinBox" name="undeadHeight"><property